OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main postpones
OL,4,Ahospital operations
OL,5,
OL,6,FOperations have been postponed at a
OL,7,Fhospital in north London because of a
OL,8,Fburst water main.
OL,10,FChase Farm Hospital in Enfield had no
OL,11,Fwater supply to its operating theatres
OL,12,Fon Wednesday and had to rely on Thames
OL,13,FWater water trucks to keep normal
OL,14,Fservice running.
OL,16,FA hospital spokesperson said back-up
OL,17,Fwater tanks were on site and the water
OL,18,Fsupply was "expected to return to
OL,19,Fnormal this afternoon". They said they
OL,20,Fwere expecting planned operations to go
OL,21,Fahead on Thursday as normal.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
